    <!-- FAQ -->
    <string name="compendium_title">Assistant</string>
    <string name="faq_what_q">What does this app do?</string>
    <string name="faq_what_a">It lets you browse and install free creations — addons, maps, textures and skins — for Minecraft.</string>
    <string name="faq_internet_q">Do I need an internet connection?</string>
    <string name="faq_internet_a">Yes, to browse and download. Once a file is saved you can install it offline.</string>
    <string name="faq_how_q">How do I install a creation?</string>
    <string name="faq_how_a">Open a mod, tap Get files, then tap Download. When it is saved, tap Open in Minecraft — the game starts and adds it for you.</string>
    <string name="faq_fail_q">Installation didn\'t work. What now?</string>
    <string name="faq_fail_a">Check that Minecraft is installed and updated, then open the file again. If the download never finished, turn on a VPN and get it again.</string>
    <string name="faq_stuck_q">My download is stuck.</string>
    <string name="faq_stuck_a">Usually your internet provider is blocking the server. Turn on a VPN and download again — that almost always fixes it. Any free VPN works, and you can switch it off afterwards.</string>
    <string name="faq_hidden_q">I installed it but can\'t find it in game.</string>
    <string name="faq_hidden_a">Open your world settings and switch the pack on there. Some mods also need the experiment toggles turned on.</string>
    <string name="faq_lag_q">The game lags after installing.</string>
    <string name="faq_lag_a">Big mods need a lot from your phone. Lower the render distance, or remove other packs from the world.</string>
    <string name="faq_ads_q">Why are there ads?</string>
    <string name="faq_ads_a">Ads keep the app and all creations completely free.</string>
    <string name="faq_free_q">Is everything free?</string>
    <string name="faq_free_a">Yes — every creation in the catalog is free to download and install.</string>
    <string name="faq_fresh_q">How often is new content added?</string>
    <string name="faq_fresh_a">The catalog is updated regularly with new creations.</string>
    <string name="faq_safe_q">Are the files safe for my worlds?</string>
    <string name="faq_safe_a">Yes. They use Minecraft\'s own file types. Still, back up a world you care about before adding a big mod.</string>
